    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Colin Rollinson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110807589257075488215/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKNXchkiz_dqjJMJIKPNmKKsWzyJ_wvVCTrs0SOKz4TXANcJuoY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Incredibly friendly and knowledgeable. They got back to me in 2 days with a date and took care of everything. Can't recommend them enough.",
        "time": 1765730363,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "CommonAmerican W.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112965640714819760760/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIvP9tL7u-bbpAoMSiJBBkY4LHiM0EhPvd9-0MSKSlciIIM9A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "I give Greg and Mark a very high mark as an honest, down-to-earth and a good heart/kind person in addition to their professional skills.  They rescued our little cat from a very tall branch-less tree recently with only token of appreciation as compensation.  It was such a good experience for us.\nThe event started when our little over a year old cat went out during the previous night without back home the whole night.  We are really worried the next day morning.  By noon, we sensed something must happen to it. We went out around the neighborhood to look for it and fortunately found it \"crying\" and \"meowing\" on the top of fairly high and branch-less tree inside a wooded area across street from where we are.  The cat is so desperate and frightened.  It cannot come down by itself since it is too high and it was hard to stand by hearing the \"meowing\" and looking at his staring at us helplessly on top of the tree.  We tried multiple ways to get him down by ourselves but the tree is too tall and without any branch to hold along with all the bugs and mosquitos in the woods, we failed every time.  By the later afternoon, after some research on the internet we decided to try our luck with a tree service company to see anything they can do.  It was such a good decision looking back.  When I dialed up Oliver's Tree Service, Greg answered the phone and asked about the situation and immediately agree to come by and take a look and help out.  In about 15 to 20 minutes, Greg and Mark arrived and provided a quick survey of situation.  Then they got to work and had the cat down with a container to make sure it is not too frighten to be safely coming down.  We are so pleased with the service and professionalism.  Job well done.  This is how a business and service ought to be in a well functioned society.  Thanks again, Greg and Mark for your service and work and it's great to have you guys as part of the community.",
        "time": 1626452079,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "shawn enos",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101573071164506247409/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIK1kX3k4D-eT3T25F8n7BXW_uWidCRVXuznAVFDRh-5wKe0Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Great team! They showed up on time and got the job done quickly and most importantly safely! They took every precaution possible when dismantling the trees to make sure no damage was done to the surrounding area. Very pleasant to work with and very fair with the price in comparison to the service level. Would highly recommend to anyone looking to have work done on their trees. Will be giving them a call for future needs if they arise!",
        "time": 1641227338,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Eileen Morrow",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100085675447303785149/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVGlWB0v5gI5Rvugo-uClSLmmzPDSFDOg1tjiDJGHurEq1VedqLag=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Greg and Mark worked fabulously as a team, extremely methodical and professional.  Work was completed in a timely fashion and the clean-up was very thorough.   I have used numerous other tree companies over the past 35+ years, and Oliver's Tree Service is the best by a long shot!  Highly recommend their services!",
        "time": 1636042181,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Chris Clarke",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111198029123769106766/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIw44-KMhd5VsoAM6i1e1VG_cRN-S4qH-Rb0HJNTt_X_paAqA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "We highly recommend Oliver's Tree Service. Greg and Mark are terrific. Such pleasant men, obviously very experienced. You'd never know any work had been done after then left as the clean-up was so thorough.",
        "time": 1686786008,
        "translated": false
